{%- comment -%}
  Compact rating line for a product, computed from the same review metaobjects
  the reviews section reads. Renders nothing at all when there is nothing to
  show, so it costs a card no space until real reviews exist and then turns
  itself on — no second pass, no placeholder pretending to be a rating.

  Usage: {% render 'product-rating', product: product %}

  Params:
    product   (required)
    compact   true renders stars and count only, no numeric average (default false)

  Which reviews count:
    A review with its `product` field pointing at this product always counts.
    Where a product has none of its own, reviews with no product set are used
    instead — they are store-level praise for a one-product catalogue, which is
    what this store is today. Link a review to a product and it stops being
    store-level, so precision arrives as the catalogue grows rather than
    requiring every review to be relinked on the day a second product lands.

  Never invents a rating: with zero reviews the whole block is absent, not a
  row of empty stars implying a score of nothing.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign reviews = metaobjects.review.values
  assign sum = 0
  assign n = 0

  for r in reviews
    if r.product.value != blank and r.product.value.id == product.id
      assign sum = sum | plus: r.rating.value
      assign n = n | plus: 1
    endif
  endfor

  if n == 0
    for r in reviews
      if r.product.value == blank
        assign sum = sum | plus: r.rating.value
        assign n = n | plus: 1
      endif
    endfor
  endif
-%}
{%- if n > 0 -%}
  {%- liquid
    assign avg = sum | times: 1.0 | divided_by: n
    assign avg_1dp = avg | round: 1
    assign filled = avg | round
  -%}
  <p class="pc-rating">
    <span class="pc-rating-stars" role="img" aria-label="Rated {{ avg_1dp }} out of 5 from {{ n }} review{% if n != 1 %}s{% endif %}">
      {%- for i in (1..5) -%}{% if i <= filled %}★{% else %}☆{% endif %}{% endfor -%}
    </span>
    {%- unless compact -%}<span class="pc-rating-avg">{{ avg_1dp }}</span>{%- endunless -%}
    <span class="pc-rating-count" aria-hidden="true">({{ n }})</span>
  </p>
{%- endif -%}
